WEBVTT

1
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.583
This is the last verse of the sixth chapter.

2
00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:39.166
In this chapter, Lord Krishna explained
 the method of yoga,

3
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:41.625
resolved Arjuna's doubts,

4
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:45.000
explained a yogi's journey
 continuing for many births,

5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.416
and the supreme state of yoga.

6
00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:51.125
Now here, they conclude this chapter

7
00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:54.375
by explaining who among all yogis

8
00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:57.500
is supreme for them.

9
00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:05.458
In this verse, Lord Krishna clarifies

10
00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:07.666
that among yogis, the one who is supreme is one

11
00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:09.250
who with unwavering faith

12
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.000
does devotion to Him

13
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.500
and constantly meditates on Him.

14
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.041
Lord Krishna explains

15
00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:19.083
that such a yogi is closest to Him.

16
00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:20.291
This verse shows

17
00:01:20.291 --> 00:01:23.333
the superiority of bhakti-yoga, which has

18
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.500
been considered superior to all other yogas.

19
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.250
In the Bhagavad Gita, Lord Krishna describes

20
00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.583
various paths of yoga:

21
00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:34.041
Karma-yoga –

22
00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:37.083
which happens through selfless action.

23
00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:40.208
Jñāna-yoga where the yogi

24
00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:42.166
through knowledge and

25
00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:44.500
study of scriptures makes spiritual progress.

26
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.500
Aṣṭāṅga-yoga, which is yoga
 of meditation and restraint,

27
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.708
but ultimately

28
00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:53.083
all these lead only toward bhakti-yoga.

29
00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:54.333
Lord Krishna is

30
00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:57.000
saying a very important thing here.

31
00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:57.708
The purpose

32
00:01:57.708 --> 00:01:58.791
of all yogas

33
00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:01.500
is to come close to Paramātmā Lord Krishna.

34
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.208
But the yogi who has adopted the path

35
00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:06.208
of unwavering devotion to Lord Krishna,

36
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:08.750
establishes a direct relationship with

37
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:12.666
Paramātmā Lord Krishna
 and for this very reason

38
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:15.791
that yogi is ahead of other yogis

39
00:02:15.791 --> 00:02:17.375
in the spiritual journey.

40
00:02:17.375 --> 00:02:18.833
The second important thing

41
00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:21.541
here is that devotion is not just

42
00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:24.625
one stage of spirituality, 
rather complete devotion

43
00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:27.625
itself is the final goal of spirituality.

44
00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:31.500
Through bhakti-yoga, a yogi,
 through their service,

45
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.708
love, and surrender, directly meets Paramātmā.

46
00:02:36.708 --> 00:02:38.833
This verse also prepares the ground

47
00:02:38.833 --> 00:02:42.416
for the coming chapters of the Bhagavad Gita,

48
00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:45.291
where Lord Krishna will explain the importance

49
00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:48.250
of bhakti-yoga in more detail.

50
00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:56.250
It's important to understand

51
00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.375
that the final goal of yoga is not only physical

52
00:02:59.375 --> 00:03:03.625
health or mental peace –

53
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:08.083
yoga is the name of reaching that state,

54
00:03:08.083 --> 00:03:11.750
where you have deep devotion

55
00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.750
toward Paramātmā, boundless love.

56
00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.958
Yoga connects you to Paramātmā

57
00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:23.875
and there are many paths for this union –

58
00:03:23.875 --> 00:03:28.208
karma yoga which is the path of selfless action,

59
00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.750
jñāna yoga, which is the path

60
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.958
of knowledge and study of scriptures,

61
00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:36.375
dhyāna yoga which is the path

62
00:03:36.375 --> 00:03:40.166
of focusing mind and meditation and restraint.

63
00:03:40.166 --> 00:03:42.083
And then,

64
00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:43.916
Bhakti Yoga,

65
00:03:43.916 --> 00:03:47.666
which is the path of love and devotion,

66
00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:52.416
which is the purest and the supreme. 

67
00:03:52.416 --> 00:03:57.541
When you think about
 practicing meditation in yoga,

68
00:03:57.541 --> 00:04:00.291
generally this meditation…

69
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:03.125
is focused on breath,

70
00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:06.083
which calms the mind.

71
00:04:06.083 --> 00:04:08.541
But the most excellent

72
00:04:08.541 --> 00:04:12.291
yoga is that when your heart,

73
00:04:12.291 --> 00:04:16.083
mind, and soul, all three's meditation

74
00:04:16.083 --> 00:04:21.500
is focused only and only toward Paramātmā.

75
00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.291
Whether you say Paramātmā

76
00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:27.000
or remember me.

77
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.208
It's the same thing.

78
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:34.875
I am the one pervading every particle,

79
00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:39.208
I am Paramātmā.

80
00:04:39.208 --> 00:04:41.875
When you make me the center of

81
00:04:41.875 --> 00:04:45.000
your meditation and love,

82
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:51.000
then the process of yoga doesn't remain
 some posture or physical activity,

83
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:55.458
this process becomes beautiful and divine.

84
00:04:55.458 --> 00:04:57.958
Becomes filled with love.

85
00:04:57.958 --> 00:05:00.708
Your unwavering love is

86
00:05:00.708 --> 00:05:04.708
the supreme yoga for me.

87
00:05:04.708 --> 00:05:06.916
When you keep this

88
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:10.000
love for me in your heart,

89
00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.541
when you do every activity with this very love,

90
00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:18.625
serve others with this very loving feeling,

91
00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:21.500
then your relationship with me

92
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:25.166
keeps becoming deeper every moment

93
00:05:25.166 --> 00:05:28.458
and once this relationship

94
00:05:28.458 --> 00:05:34.500
is completely connected, then it won't break.

95
00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:38.541
This relationship of love and devotion

96
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:44.666
then leaves behind all religious rituals, all yogas.

97
00:05:44.666 --> 00:05:48.083
This becomes such a lifestyle

98
00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:52.916
where your every deed becomes devotion.

99
00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:54.583
Just

100
00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:58.541
this is the supreme purpose of yoga –

101
00:05:58.541 --> 00:06:03.291
walking on the path of love and devotion,

102
00:06:03.291 --> 00:06:05.500
attaining me.

103
00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:12.833
The true strength of a family

104
00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:16.750
is in mutual love and relationships.

105
00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.500
And if the entire family, sharing together,

106
00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.166
walks on the path of devotion,

107
00:06:23.166 --> 00:06:25.916
starts loving Paramātmā,

108
00:06:25.916 --> 00:06:31.083
then their mutual relationship
 becomes unbreakable.

109
00:06:31.083 --> 00:06:32.625
Bhakti yoga

110
00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:35.875
connects you to me,

111
00:06:35.875 --> 00:06:40.541
but also strengthens the family

112
00:06:40.541 --> 00:06:46.916
because now everyone has connected
 to each other through me.

113
00:06:46.916 --> 00:06:51.291
Bhakti-yoga is yoga of love and surrender,

114
00:06:51.291 --> 00:06:55.000
and it's superior to all yogas.

115
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:55.750
When a

116
00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.916
family adopts this feeling,

117
00:06:58.916 --> 00:07:06.666
then that family becomes a spiritual
 center of affection and unity.

118
00:07:06.666 --> 00:07:08.458
To make bhakti yoga part

119
00:07:08.458 --> 00:07:15.791
of family life, it can be started
 with small activities –

120
00:07:15.791 --> 00:07:19.916
all family members pray together,

121
00:07:19.916 --> 00:07:25.583
collective time is set for study of scriptures,

122
00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:28.291
discussion happens on teachings of the Gita.

123
00:07:28.291 --> 00:07:33.291
These activities not only increase mutual love,

124
00:07:33.291 --> 00:07:36.958
but also become means for everyone's

125
00:07:36.958 --> 00:07:40.708
spiritual progress.

126
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:44.875
And it's also natural that questions and doubts

127
00:07:44.875 --> 00:07:49.750
related to this will arise in some family members.

128
00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.958
Don't reject these questions,

129
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:53.833
welcome them.

130
00:07:53.833 --> 00:07:55.791
Just as Arjuna expressed

131
00:07:55.791 --> 00:07:59.541
his doubts before me,

132
00:07:59.541 --> 00:08:02.875
you too create such an atmosphere

133
00:08:02.875 --> 00:08:04.291
where everyone has freedom

134
00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:07.333
to ask questions and doubts

135
00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:11.583
related to spirituality.

136
00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:13.375
This is an opportunity

137
00:08:13.375 --> 00:08:17.416
where while resolving family members' doubts,

138
00:08:17.416 --> 00:08:21.625
your spiritual knowledge will become stronger.

139
00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:25.291
Also, when doubts are resolved,

140
00:08:25.291 --> 00:08:28.250
family members' faith in spirituality
 will also increase.

141
00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.291
Understand it like this –

142
00:08:30.291 --> 00:08:33.333
the entire family is helping

143
00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:38.791
each other's spiritual progress.

144
00:08:38.791 --> 00:08:41.458
How beautiful is this imagination

145
00:08:41.458 --> 00:08:44.000
where everyone is united,

146
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.875
everyone has started connecting
 with me, and as a result,

147
00:08:48.875 --> 00:08:56.500
everyone is getting bound in an unbreakable
 relationship of mutual love.

148
00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:02.791
In the professional world,

149
00:09:02.791 --> 00:09:07.250
the measure of success is often done
 by achievement of goals,

150
00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:11.333
salary increase, and promotion.

151
00:09:11.333 --> 00:09:12.916
But

152
00:09:12.916 --> 00:09:17.708
true self-satisfaction doesn't
 come from all these.

153
00:09:17.708 --> 00:09:20.666
The mind gets true fulfillment

154
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:23.666
when you have a loving relationship,

155
00:09:23.666 --> 00:09:26.750
not only with your work,

156
00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.666
but with your colleagues

157
00:09:29.666 --> 00:09:32.166
and with the purposes of that organization

158
00:09:32.166 --> 00:09:35.375
for which you're working.

159
00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:38.666
When there's love and respect 
for all these in the mind,

160
00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:43.916
then working itself will become
 the source of your fulfillment.

161
00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:46.958
As I have clarified in the Gita,

162
00:09:46.958 --> 00:09:49.583
the best yoga is that 

163
00:09:49.583 --> 00:09:52.708
which is done with love and devotion.

164
00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:54.250
And you can adopt this very perspective

165
00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.833
in professional settings too.

166
00:09:57.833 --> 00:10:00.833
When you adopt this perspective of yoga,

167
00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:04.166
then no work will seem like a burden,

168
00:10:04.166 --> 00:10:07.041
rather every work will become the path of your

169
00:10:07.041 --> 00:10:11.375
spiritual progress and self-satisfaction.

170
00:10:11.375 --> 00:10:14.583
Think like a yogi

171
00:10:14.583 --> 00:10:19.500
your every work makes someone's life easy,

172
00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:23.416
this too is devotion toward me.

173
00:10:23.416 --> 00:10:27.666
When you help colleagues lovingly,

174
00:10:27.666 --> 00:10:31.250
you're also doing my devotion.

175
00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:36.583
Because if I pervade everyone,

176
00:10:36.583 --> 00:10:40.416
then every work done with love

177
00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:43.541
becomes my devotion.

178
00:10:43.541 --> 00:10:45.500
Becomes yoga.

179
00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:49.083
When you do your work like this –

180
00:10:49.083 --> 00:10:50.750
with surrender, with devotion –

181
00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.000
then external success is definitely received,

182
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:58.958
but along with this, you also establish
 inner peace, satisfaction,

183
00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:06.250
and a spiritual relationship with me.
